r","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids September to October came in under 90% of normal in 34 of 75 years. In 2025 the middle of the grids had March to April at 71% and November to December at 76%. So far in 2026, March to April came in at 57% on the middle. Grid 20592 had its driest year in 1988 at 70%.</p>"}
